// Engine functions that sithMulti.c calls and that the vector tests replace with the stubs of sithMultiVec.h.
// The capture harness patches each original function to jump to the stub; the tests rename the calls of sithMulti.c to
// the stub (N -> msv_N, see CMakeLists.txt). The CRT rand of sithMulti.c is renamed in sithMultiTested.c (the harness
// patches the rand of the executable, see tv/sithMulti/README.md).
